    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The dead magic zones of the Anauroch desert are loathed by spellcasters and magical monsters—which is exactly why you settled there. Maybe you were fleeing the Red Wizards, or you crossed a powerful djinni in Calimshan. Whatever the reason, Anauroch seemed your best option. After long months or years there, you are stronger and wiser, and you know a great deal about desert medicine and surviving in the wastes.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Constitution, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.1M64ZpNOx4YSXXDu]{Healer}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Medicine and Survival</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulLeatherwor]{Leatherworker's Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepGreatclub0]{Greatclub}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulLeatherwor]{Leatherworker's Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBedroll0000]{Bedroll}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBlanket0000]{Blanket}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagHealersKit0]{Healer's Kit}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPole0000000]{Pole}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRations0000]{Rations} (3 days' worth), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTent0000000]{Tent}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTinderbox00]{Tinderbox}, 5 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTorch000000]{Torches}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagWaterskin00]{Waterskin}, 32 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
